<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AI Attendance - AI-Powered Attendance Management</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <style>
      /* Palette. --surface is derived from --text-primary at low alpha so
         raised panels stay on the same colour axis as everything else. */
      :root {
        --background: #000f0d;
        --text-primary: #f6f7f6;
        --text-secondary: #b6bbb7;
        --border: rgba(246, 247, 246, 0.22);
        --border-strong: rgba(246, 247, 246, 0.9);
        --surface: rgba(246, 247, 246, 0.04);
        --surface-raised: rgba(246, 247, 246, 0.07);
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        height: 100%;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      /* Only 400/500/600/700 are shipped - never exceed 700 or the browser
         synthesises a faux bold. */
      body {
        font-family:
          "Inter",
          -apple-system,
          BlinkMacSystemFont,
          "Segoe UI",
          Roboto,
          "Helvetica Neue",
          Arial,
          sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        background: var(--background);
        min-height: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      }

      .landing-page {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        width: 100%;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      /* Navigation */
      .navbar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1rem 5%;
        background: var(--background);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.625rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        background: var(--text-primary);
        color: var(--background);
      }

      /* Hero */
      .hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 5rem 5% 4rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      /* Eyebrow - carries the product category so the h1 is free to sell the
         benefit. Letter-spacing is positive here, unlike the tight h1.
         Must be scoped to .hero: a bare .eyebrow (0,1,0) loses to .hero p
         (0,1,1) and would inherit the paragraph size and margin. */
      .hero .eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        word-wrap: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
        margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        max-width: 620px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: var(--text-primary);
        color: var(--background);
        padding: 0.875rem 2.25rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1rem;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border: 1px solid var(--text-primary);
        min-width: 190px;
        text-align: center;
        touch-action: manipulation;
      }

      .cta-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(246, 247, 246, 0.14);
      }

      .cta-button:active {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      /* Demo */
      .demo {
        padding: 1rem 5% 5rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .demo-frame {
        max-width: 740px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .demo-titlebar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        background: var(--surface-raised);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .demo-dot {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--border);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .demo-title {
        margin-left: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
      }

      .demo-body {
        padding: 1.5rem;
        font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text-primary);
      }

      .demo-head {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .demo-msg {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        padding-left: 0.875rem;
        border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
      }

      .demo-msg:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .demo-msg.is-employee {
        border-left-color: var(--border-strong);
      }

      .demo-msg.is-system {
        border-left-color: #4ade80;
      }

      .demo-meta {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      }

      .demo-text {
        word-wrap: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      /* Features */
      .features {
        padding: 4rem 5% 5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex: 1;
      }

      .features h2 {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 280px), 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .feature-card {
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        transition: all 0.25s;
      }

      .feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        border-color: var(--border-strong);
      }

      .feature-icon {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: block;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.1875rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem 5%;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-top: auto;
      }

      .footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
      }

      /* Mobile Optimizations */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .navbar {
          padding: 1rem 4%;
        }

        .logo {
          font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
          padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
          font-size: 0.9375rem;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 3.5rem 4% 3rem;
        }

        .demo {
          padding: 1rem 4% 3.5rem;
        }

        .features {
          padding: 3rem 4%;
        }

        .features h2 {
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .features-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
          padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 1.75rem 4%;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .navbar {
          padding: 0.875rem 5%;
        }

        .logo {
          font-size: 1.125rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
          padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
          font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 3rem 5% 2.5rem;
        }

        .cta-button {
          padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 320px;
        }

        .demo {
          padding: 1rem 5% 3rem;
        }

        .demo-body {
          padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
          font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        .features {
          padding: 2.5rem 5%;
        }

        .features-grid {
          gap: 1rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
          padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 1.5rem 5%;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 375px) {
        .navbar {
          padding: 0.75rem 4%;
        }

        .logo {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
          padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
          font-size: 0.8125rem;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 2.5rem 4% 2rem;
        }

        .hero .eyebrow {
          font-size: 0.75rem;
          letter-spacing: 0.12em;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
          font-size: 1.625rem;
        }

        .cta-button {
          padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
          font-size: 0.9375rem;
        }

        .demo-body {
          padding: 1rem 0.875rem;
        }

        .features {
          padding: 2rem 4%;
        }

        .feature-card {
          padding: 1.25rem 0.875rem;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
          font-size: 1.0625rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
          font-size: 0.9375rem;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 1.25rem 4%;
        }

        .footer p {
          font-size: 0.8125rem;
        }
      }

      /* Touch device optimizations */
      @media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {
        .cta-button,
        .nav-links a {
          min-height: 44px;
          display: inline-flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
        }

        .feature-card:hover,
        .cta-button:hover {
          transform: none;
        }
      }

      /* Landscape phone optimization */
      @media (max-height: 500px) and (orientation: landscape) {
        .hero {
          padding: 2rem 5%;
        }

        .hero h1 {
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
          margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="landing-page">
    <nav class="navbar">
      <div class="logo">AI Attendance</div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/login">Login</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Employee Attendance Management</p>
      <h1>Automate employee call-ins with AI</h1>
      <p>
        When employees can't make it to work, they text the AI assistant instead
        of the manager. AI handles the conversation &amp; reporting.
      </p>
      <a href="/login" class="cta-button">Get Started</a>
    </section>

    <section class="demo">
      <div class="demo-frame">
        <div class="demo-titlebar">
          <span class="demo-dot"></span>
          <span class="demo-dot"></span>
          <span class="demo-dot"></span>
          <span class="demo-title">SMS Conversation Transcript</span>
        </div>

        <div class="demo-body">
          <div class="demo-head">
            Employee: John Doe<br />
            Date: Monday 2026-08-03<br />
            Method: SMS
          </div>

          <div class="demo-msg is-employee">
            <div class="demo-meta">[8:58:52 PM] 👤 Employee</div>
            <div class="demo-text">I can't come in tomorrow</div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-msg is-system">
            <div class="demo-meta">[8:58:54 PM] 🤖 System</div>
            <div class="demo-text">
              Hi John, what's the reason? (e.g., appointment, errands, family
              matter)
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-msg is-employee">
            <div class="demo-meta">[8:59:05 PM] 👤 Employee</div>
            <div class="demo-text">I have an appointment</div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-msg is-system">
            <div class="demo-meta">[8:59:07 PM] 🤖 System</div>
            <div class="demo-text">
              Got it, John. Logged: out all day (personal) tomorrow -
              Appointment. ✅ If that's not right, just reply and tell me what
              to change.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
          <h3>They Text via SMS</h3>
          <p>
            Your employee sends a normal text message to report they can't make
            a shift. No app for them to install, no portal to log into. Any
            phone that sends a text works.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>The AI Writes the Record</h3>
          <p>
            It asks the reason, then writes the attendance record for you. No
            spreadsheets to update, no notes to write up afterwards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>You Get Full Visibility</h3>
          <p>
            Every report lands in your dashboard the moment it comes in, with
            the whole conversation attached so you can read back exactly what
            was said.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> AI Attendance.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
